    Shape:
        - Input: :math:`(N, C, H_{in}, W_{in})` or :math:`(C, H_{in}, W_{in})`.
        - Output: :math:`(N, C, H_{out}, W_{out})` or :math:`(C, H_{out}, W_{out})`, where
