                      Note that we must have :math:`kH + (output\_ratio\_H * H_{in}) - 1 <= H_{in}`
                      and :math:`kW + (output\_ratio\_W * W_{in}) - 1 <= W_{in}`
        return_indices: if ``True``, will return the indices along with the outputs.
